    zenity: the dialogs a program asks for by running zenity, as rfd does, drawn on the
    page with egui: --file-selection [--save] [--directory] [--multiple]
    [--filename PATH] [--file-filter 'NAME | *.EXT ...'], and --info, --warning,
    --error or --question with --title, --text and the button labels. It takes the
    page from the program that runs it and gives it back when it exits; it prints the
